{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute the unknown elements of $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -8\\end{aligned}], &  & \\,-3=1\\cdot 2+2\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -8\\end{aligned}], &  & \\,-8=0\\cdot 1+3\\cdot 0+4\\cdot (-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nAB=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -8\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317846/field-1" "q-317846/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92dd864a-8bc0-547c-84c9-ffd562909315"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317846"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129495/selection/7291d8f1f7c5e09d66036eb77e67f226cb157a2ebc93fef715b36325c216fef9" :answer/id #uuid "3da91b23-c9b6-5724-bae6-01fcb033562a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 6 \\\\ -3 & 10\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129495/selection/7ce58b20853244dd3809b68cbfbdd2f87b20dc89a978931be00265f96eb93b77" :answer/id #uuid "27016ec8-5211-58f4-88fa-593840b3ca68" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-15 & 3 \\\\ -9 & 10\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129495/selection/7b780d3537cee5cb2eaa651ba614556feb5670128e2e9ba52bf4756cd2619820" :answer/id #uuid "9e5f6ce3-4413-5f1d-a3ff-afcaf4a9ab5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-15 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129495/selection/7169ea3980695d27f57bd1310d57ad5266637f84bd00319ea1062152716d50b5" :answer/id #uuid "252f0c75-7179-57a2-9665-70b5ebb8d710" :an